{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24739","headline":"送滕庶子致仕归婺州 · 白居易","name":"送滕庶子致仕归婺州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春风秋月携歌酒，八十年来翫物华。\n已见曾孙骑竹马，犹听侍女唱梅花。\n入乡不杖归时健，出郭乘轺到处夸。\n儿着绣衣身衣锦，东阳门户胜滕家。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24739.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24739","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}